The cold-tier test uses the real SQLite event/projector path and zstandard;
the normal Engine retrieve inflates the durable row and restores text and
metadata. The assembly test uses public Engine.assemble with a deterministic
test double only at the optional compressor boundary. Its budget equals the
repository's documented chars/4 estimate for expected compressed output, with
no added margin. It is not exact model-token accounting or semantic-quality
evidence for LLMLingua.
